 <use xlink:href=\"#E8-MJMAIN-30\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E8-MJMAIN-2E\" x=\"500\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E8-MJMAIN-34\" x=\"779\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E8-MJMAIN-36\" x=\"1279\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E8-MJMAIN-34\" x=\"1780\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n<g transform=\"translate(0,-1450)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E8-MJMAIN-2212\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(778,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E8-MJMAIN-30\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E8-MJMAIN-2E\" x=\"500\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E8-MJMAIN-35\" x=\"779\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E8-MJMAIN-35\" x=\"1279\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E8-MJMAIN-35\" x=\"1780\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n<g transform=\"translate(11389,2150)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E8-MJSZ4-23A4\" x=\"0\" y=\"-1155\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(0,-2048.5066225165565) scale(1,0.49337748344370863)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E8-MJSZ4-23A5\"></use>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E8-MJSZ4-23A6\" x=\"0\" y=\"-3155\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</svg></span></p>\n<p>We will use principal component analysis to reduce the dimensionality of the dataset. </p>\n<p>In order to reduce the dimensionality of the dataset, we will project the data onto the first few principal components.</p>\n<p>Fill in the blanks below:</p>\n<p>We should pick components based on \n<span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"42.858ex\" height=\"3.343ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.838ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -1078.4 18452.5 1439.2\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-9-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-9-Title\">\\fbox{<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"16\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mphantom><mjx-mi class=